suite didn\u0026#39;t cover\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\n\n[Compare with previous version](/videolan/dav2d-test-data/-/merge_requests/9/diffs?diff_id=1637908\u0026start_sha=fc061983a587f16f9bdfa45a0e18380be8f9cbba)","author":{"id":6557,"username":"EwoutH","public_email":"","name":"Ewout ter Hoeven","state":"active","locked":false,"avatar_url":"https://code.videolan.org/uploads/-/system/user/avatar/6557/avatar.png?v=1795080075","web_url":"https://code.videolan.org/EwoutH"},"created_at":"2026-11-19T18:44:11.339Z","updated_at":"2026-11-19T18:44:11.341Z","system":true,"noteable_id":27126,"noteable_type":"MergeRequest","project_id":5245,"resolvable":false,"confidential":false,"internal":false,"imported":false,"imported_from":"none","noteable_iid":9,"commands_changes":{}},{"id":598396,"type":null,"body":"I ran that job locally (av2-normative + dav2d's `patches/`, the same debug defines, dav2d main b130414d) over all 35 samples in main + !6 + this MR. All 35 match in MD5, but only 14 give an identical trace:\n\n- already in the job's list: the six `avm-v15.0.0-*` ones\n- not in it yet: `avm.bus.128x96.l5.qm1`, `avm.bus.96x64.l5.qm1-cctx`, `avm.bus.176x144.l5.opfl2`, `avm.bus.480x144.l2.tilecols2`, `avm-v15.0.0-bus.352x288.l1.partial_lossless`, `avm.rot.128x128.l8.opfl-refine0` (!6), and in `avm-10bit` `avm.bus.128x96.l8.10bit.s4` and `avm.bus.176x144.l2.10bit.qp208`\n\nThe other 21 (including all 12 here) differ in the trace itself, mostly in the pixel dumps and prediction lines. The decoded output is identical, so it looks like gaps in the debug prints rather than decoder bugs, but I haven't gone through each one. So syncing the lists automatically would make the job fail for now.\n\nWhat I'd suggest:\n\n1. Add the 8 trace-clean samples to the job now (the two 10-bit ones need the loop to look in `avm-10bit` too).\n2. Instead of a list in dav2d's CI, test-data could mark which samples are trace-clean (e.g. a list file next to `meson.build`). This CI would then run the same trace diff with dav2d main + `patches/` on those, so it's known when a sample is added whether it's trace-clean. dav2d's job would read the same list.\n3. The 12-bit option only matters once a 12-bit sample is in the list. It doesn't change anything else in the build, so it could go in together with the first one.\n4. Separately, I can look at the debug prints for the other 21, so more samples become trace-clean.\n\nWhich of these would you like? I can do 1 and 2 as MRs here and in dav2d.","author":{"id":6557,"username":"EwoutH","public_email":"","name":"Ewout ter Hoeven","state":"active","locked":false,"avatar_url":"https://code.videolan.org/uploads/-/system/user/avatar/6557/avatar.png?v=1795080075","web_url":"https://code.videolan.org/EwoutH"},"created_at":"2026-11-19T18:28:30.870Z","updated_at":"2026-11-19T18:28:30.870Z","system":false,"noteable_id":27126,"noteable_type":"MergeRequest","project_id":5245,"resolvable":false,"confidential":false,"internal":false,"imported":false,"imported_from":"none","noteable_iid":9,"commands_changes":{}},{"id":598388,"type":"DiffNote","body":"So I know that the files that we do the AVM debug testing in dav2d has its own smaller list of sequences to go through... Do we want to sync the lists and add more samples there automatically? If so, should this config option be added there also? And should that feature be tested in this CI?","author":{"id":6740,"username":"rbultje","public_email":"","name":"Ronald S. Bultje","state":"active","locked":false,"avatar_url":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/2bbbba94f2c431540192d48ae54a84282cee5c038cf1c1aa8b699b2322a41ee6?s=80\u0026d=identicon","web_url":"https://code.videolan.org/rbultje"},"created_at":"2026-11-19T18:19:41.049Z","updated_at":"2026-11-19T18:19:41.049Z","system":false,"noteable_id":27126,"noteable_type":"MergeRequest","project_id":5245,"commit_id":"3e45e2be541adb4fe6ee5024cd5f973e531d22e3","position":{"base_sha":"85af1c29ebc26acfe4efc8ebb5b76161b40cbc05","start_sha":"85af1c29ebc26acfe4efc8ebb5b76161b40cbc05","head_sha":"074f8dbe33d45c46200ee15b155b076a804293b9","old_path":".gitlab-ci.yml","new_path":".gitlab-ci.yml","position_type":"text","old_line":162,"new_line":162,"line_range":{"start":{"old_line":162,"new_line":162,"type":null},"end":{"old_line":162,"new_line":162,"type":null}}},"resolvable":true,"resolved":false,"resolved_by":null,"resolved_at":null,"suggestions":[],"confidential":false,"internal":false,"imported":false,"imported_from":"none","noteable_iid":9,"commands_changes":{}},{"id":598386,"type":null,"body":"changed the description","author":{"id":6557,"username":"EwoutH","public_email":"","name":"Ewout ter Hoeven","state":"active","locked":false,"avatar_url":"https://code.videolan.org/uploads/-/system/user/avatar/6557/avatar.png?v=1795080075","web_url":"https://code.videolan.org/EwoutH"},"created_at":"2026-11-19T18:16:40.727Z","updated_at":"2026-11-19T18:16:40.729Z","system":true,"noteable_id":27126,"noteable_type":"MergeRequest","project_id":5245,"resolvable":false,"confidential":false,"internal":false,"imported":false,"imported_from":"none","noteable_iid":9,"commands_changes":{}},{"id":598385,"type":null,"body":"added 2 commits\n\n\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e3e45e2be - CI: build avmdec with 12-bit support\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003efc061983 - Add samples for formats and tools the suite didn\u0026#39;t cover\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\n\n[Compare with previous version](/videolan/dav2d-test-data/-/merge_requests/9/diffs?diff_id=1637889\u0026start_sha=862aa1b96c94b1b114babef66a6359a90844f8dd)","author":{"id":6557,"username":"EwoutH","public_email":"","name":"Ewout ter Hoeven","state":"active","locked":false,"avatar_url":"https://code.videolan.org/uploads/-/system/user/avatar/6557/avatar.png?v=1795080075","web_url":"https://code.videolan.org/EwoutH"},"created_at":"2026-11-19T18:16:34.844Z","updated_at":"2026-11-19T18:16:34.847Z","system":true,"noteable_id":27126,"noteable_type":"MergeRequest","project_id":5245,"resolvabl